  "question": {
    "text": "The function <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>22</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn></math> attains local maximum or minimum at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math> Then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></math> are in",
    "image": null
