  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>44</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />So, <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1,</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br />which are the points of local extremum.<br />i.e., <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></math> are in <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math></p>",
